Yet I would also be wary of tearing down the council itself. The council is what allows us to face each season together. The proper response is not to declare the whole process worthless, but to recognize that it failed here and must correct itself—that self-correction is precisely the deeper strength of consensus. So I weight most heavily the view that the exclusion invalidates this particular decision and that the process must be reconvened to include the women's voices.

